{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_title", "source_sha256": "9e03c30b199b5ce8f73cbe5b2cca8bbdcd582a69e87faf3c1cd39651df2f799f", "ja": "律子と舞台裏", "zh": "律子与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1557cb2a8b26bfa0b3ffb2d0f0df12d71f345c55b8b25832463af7628e31fcc0", "ja": "律子との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "与律子在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aafff968c30f48f892b748e8682cc6922663e5b2ec5df5204142efc66343ce55", "ja": "（ライブは目立った問題もなく順調に進行中！\nみんなもほどよい緊張を保って臨んでいるな……）", "zh": "（演唱会进行得很顺利，没有出现什么明显的问题！大家也都保持着适度的紧张感，全身心投入其中啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "063c863a5980f56c3de2189a3c65733f1b66ca99101b4fda6ebff0ff8195b8bc", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。こんなところに。\nちょっと気になったことがあって……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。原来你在这里。\n我有件事有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "0259ac1b4edb53f1c392093f37a6452d64c2b8bf08c841d710378dc3a6241cc8", "ja": "貴音のマイク、さっき一瞬ノイズ入ったみたいで。\nソロで出る前に、念のため交換した方がいいかと。", "zh": "貴音的麦克风刚才好像有一瞬间出现了杂音。她在单独登台前，最好还是以防万一换一个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1003_p", "source_sha256": "93ca3f0777934aac2d8289a5c15a4aeca583291e6aa1c50c41c94597588f2ce4", "ja": "おお、報告ありがとう。\n確かにそれは交換しておいたほうがいいな。", "zh": "哦，谢谢你的报告。确实，还是先换掉比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "13e99b47b3fcbf8b88a7f061beb0a3a4f40c729072c6178435a29734fa48b3b0", "ja": "あと、西側の通路がちょっとガタついてるみたいで、\n何人かつまづいてて。固定してもらいましょうか？", "zh": "还有，西侧的通道好像有点晃动不稳，\n有好几个人都被绊了一下。要叫人去固定一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a5c02ee525454d3d36feb2dcc6850c8cbb0aab45b4df200e8421028d465e30b9", "ja": "そうだな……というか、俺が頼んでおくよ。\nマイクも手配しておくから、律子は休んでくれ。", "zh": "是啊……不如说，我来拜托他们吧。\n麦克风我也会安排好的，律子你休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "653abe8c878092d07d4469b2b3577fd1fbadc76cf13e792ce201109026ef9e95", "ja": "え。別に、どっちか私やりますけど。\n大舞台なんだし、分担した方が効率いいでしょう？", "zh": "诶？也没什么，我来做哪一项都行。\n毕竟是大舞台，分工合作效率更高吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1007_p", "source_sha256": "31895a664dae2fbc3829b32ece0a45940fe57b494ff625abee2f3a324f25e13c", "ja": "いや、律子にはそろそろ\nアイドル全力モードに切り替えてもらいたいんだ。", "zh": "不，我是想让律子你差不多\n切换到偶像全力模式了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a86424c456daeefe6814e585b1c073a52d2acbcf931e6c64e1cc7d0979182153", "ja": "そろそろ律子メインのステージだから。\n……まさか、忘れてないよな？", "zh": "马上就要轮到律子担任主角的舞台了。\n……你该不会忘了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "2c09ede4ef4202105298c2694ea553e9eb28b812fc6815fe810b34ab36a9ee81", "ja": "うっ……もちろん、わかってますよ？\nわかってますけど……。", "zh": "唔……我当然知道啦？\n虽然知道是知道啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "224773ce41612693d74962be7425a7cd8dcb80a42e727ef7273ddb97015ccf1b", "ja": "だからこそ、なにかやってないと\n落ち着かないんですー！", "zh": "正因为如此，不做点什么就静不下心来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4861d6a1bd38e16d2101e57277c387c268b9f2b98f1b457c12edc7388cc259bf", "ja": "はは、なるほど。\n相変わらずってことか。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n也就是说，你还是老样子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dfa9eab9cc6104e7d0d48c5054ea0ecabcf4dfd411eb119b84cb4859cb66a280", "ja": "でも、心配ないと思うけどな。\nステージには頼もしい仲間たちがいるんだから。", "zh": "不过，我觉得你不用担心。\n毕竟舞台上有那么多可靠的伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "bca223fac4e93c63ba48a659fe032da90ce986ee67ee890945ce7b8e7da77b73", "ja": "それも……当然わかってます。誰よりも。\nあと、背中を預けられる人が、ここにいるってことも。", "zh": "这点……我当然知道。比谁都清楚。\n\n还有，我也知道，这里有可以让我托付后背的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5db7b86a7e56268d14aea093cc357c69e03294e63c097a04e377908791236037", "ja": "ああ、後ろは任せてくれ。さっきの件も含めて。\n律子は全力で、前だけ向いて行こう！", "zh": "啊，后方就交给我吧。包括刚才那件事也是。\n律子，你就全力向前，只管往前走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "db69dba27e5ed6b1b9ea99668348ee9cd3864ea9539699376fa6db1efc08991d", "ja": "簡単に言うなぁ、もう……。はいはい、わかりました！\nそれじゃ、お言葉に甘えさせてもらって、と。", "zh": "别说得那么轻松嘛，真是的……好好好，我明白了！\n那我就恭敬不如从命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_009rit_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "056be0df3670dabe1b2da9a8292be33a53fd199d41a93fee759f169eee05ece4", "ja": "秋月律子、ここからはアイドル一直線で！\n……行ってきます！", "zh": "秋月律子，从现在开始一路走偶像之路！\n……我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
